OL,3,GNEWSADelay to neonatal reform is
OL,4,Aputting babies at risk, warn doctors
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe lives of some of the smallest and
OL,7,Fsickest babies in Scotland are being
OL,8,Fput at risk because of delays in
OL,9,Freorganising neonatal care, doctors
OL,10,Fhave warned.
OL,12,FThe Scottish government's controversial
OL,13,Fplan to cut the number of neonatal
OL,14,Fintensive care units from eight to
OL,15,Fthree was announced in 2017, but has
OL,16,Fnot yet been implemented.
OL,18,FDoctors and charities who support the
OL,19,Fproposals say they would save lives `
OL,20,Fbut have accused ministers of failing
OL,21,Fto ensure there are enough cots or
OL,22,Fstaff to safely implement the move.
OL,23,APub: 16-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,423,420,260,160,0,100
